(7467709, 1185053, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An excellent image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>A great action shot that captures the challenge of the climb well, in terms of the challenge brief he is in a difficult position though I think perhaps you could have given him a bit more of a tilt to enhance the effect more and to more closely fulfil the challenge brief. I like your composition though I wish we could see your son''s face but the clever inclusion of the other climber to a degree alleviates this by showing the intense concentration needed to negotiate the wall. You must be well proud of his achievement, well done to both of you.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An excellent image that contributes well to the challenge A great action shot that captures the challenge of the climb well, in terms of the challenge brief he is in a difficult position though I think perhaps you could have given him a bit more of a tilt to enhance the effect more and to more closely fulfil the challenge brief. I like your composition though I wish we could see your son''s face but the clever inclusion of the other climber to a degree alleviates this by showing the intense concentration needed to negotiate the wall. You must be well proud of his achievement, well done to both of you.', '2016-08-08 06:42:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7467747, 1185232, 109227, '<td valign="top">I love the light and shadows.  Well done my friend.</td>', 'I love the light and shadows.  Well done my friend.', '2016-08-08 10:48:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7467749, 1184969, 63218, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the Yellow!<br/>I am pleased that the one comment was mine. It is a challenging comp to comment on because of the powerful cloud. I admired it greatly but couldn''t think of much to say. We see this camera upward camera angle on tall buildings all the time, but not with such big piece of sky, with a dominant cloud, with black rays. It changed everything. When I said ''don''t hesitate'' I meant sometimes you have to shoot, &amp; then ask questions in PP later. I wanted to give it a 10 but didn''t because of the multiple narrow bands of light grey in the sky between the cloud &amp; the building.</td>', 'Congratulations on the Yellow!I am pleased that the one comment was mine. It is a challenging comp to comment on because of the powerful cloud. I admired it greatly but couldn''t think of much to say. We see this camera upward camera angle on tall buildings all the time, but not with such big piece of sky, with a dominant cloud, with black rays. It changed everything. When I said ''don''t hesitate'' I meant sometimes you have to shoot, & then ask questions in PP later. I wanted to give it a 10 but didn''t because of the multiple narrow bands of light grey in the sky between the cloud & the building.', '2016-08-08 11:01:21.000000', NULL, 0),
